<title>USA: MicroTel, XIT complete merger.</title>
<headline>MicroTel, XIT complete merger.</headline>
<dateline>ONTARIO, Calif. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>MicroTel International Inc on Wednesday said it has completed the merger of Ontario, Calif.-based XIT Corp with a new unit of MicroTel.</p>
<p>XIT is the surviving entity. Its shareholders were issued about 6.1 million common shares of MicroTel, or about 65.8 percent of MicroTel's issued and outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>XIT holders were also issued options and warrants to acquire over 2.1 million more shares.</p>
<p>Carmine Oliva, XIT's chief executive officer, became the new chairman and chief executive of MicroTel.</p>
</text>
